## Key Concepts
- On-device vs. cloud inference trade-offs
- Energy budgeting and latency SLA management
- Privacy regulations and user consent workflows
- Phased rollout strategies with cohort-based deployment
- Drift detection and model maintenance cycles

## Code Example
